                                         rdfs:comment "The relationship between a monitored person and their caregiver." ;
                                         rdfs:label "is care recipient of" .


###  http://purl.org/phmo#isCaregiverOf
<http://purl.org/phmo#isCaregiverOf> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                     rdfs:domain <http://purl.org/phmo#Caregiver> ;
                                     rdfs:range <http://purl.org/phmo#MonitoredPerson> ;
                                     rdfs:comment "The relationship between a caregiver and their care recipient, a monitored person." ;
                                     rdfs:label "is caregiver of" .


###  http://purl.org/phmo#isClinicianOf
<http://purl.org/phmo#isClinicianOf> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
