###  http://purl.org/phmo#isCreatorOf
<http://purl.org/phmo#isCreatorOf> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                   owl:inverseOf <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> ;
                                   rdfs:domain [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
