                                                                                                             "support by allied health clinicians" ;
                                              rdfs:comment "A procedure where a allied health care provider who was not previously involved in a patient's treatment, reviews a patient's medical history, examines the patient, and makes recommendations as to care and treatment. This is care provided by health care practitioners who are distinct providers from dentistry, nursing, medicine, and pharmacy health care professionals." ;
                                              rdfs:label "Allied health professional evaluation"@en .


