                                                               <https://purl.org/heals/eo#SystemRecommendation> ,
                                                               <https://saref.etsi.org/core/UnitOfMeasure> ,
                                                               <https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice> ,
                                                               <https://saref.etsi.org/saref4wear/WearableDevice> ;
                                              rdfs:comment "The relationship between a risk factor, risk factory category, or risk factor state, and a medical condition." ;
                                              rdfs:label "Health risk relationship" .


###  http://purl.org/phmo#HealthRiskStatus
<http://purl.org/phmo#HealthRiskStatus> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                        rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
