###  http://purl.org/afmo#SecaScaleUpLine
:SecaScaleUpLine rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                          <https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice> ;
                 <https://saref.etsi.org/core/consistsOf> :Seca257 ,
                                                          :Seca654 ;
                 <https://saref.etsi.org/core/hasManufacturer> "Seca GmbH & Co. KG" ;
                 rdfs:comment "The seca Scale-up Line is probably the most modern and pioneering option for determining size and weight. Firstly on account of the contactless, fast, and high-precision ultrasonic measurement. Secondly because of the ID-Display, which shows the names or IDs of patients and users during data transfer to the digital patient record (EMR). This measuring station from the seca Scale-up Line is therefore the ideal choice for EMR-integrated weighing and measuring." ;
                 rdfs:label "seca Scale-up Line measuring station" .

[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
   owl:annotatedSource :SecaScaleUpLine ;
   owl:annotatedProperty rdfs:comment ;
   owl:annotatedTarget "The seca Scale-up Line is probably the most modern and pioneering option for determining size and weight. Firstly on account of the contactless, fast, and high-precision ultrasonic measurement. Secondly because of the ID-Display, which shows the names or IDs of patients and users during data transfer to the digital patient record (EMR). This measuring station from the seca Scale-up Line is therefore the ideal choice for EMR-integrated weighing and measuring." ;
   rdfs:isDefinedBy "https://www.seca.com/en_ae/products/all-products/product-details/seca654.html, accessed 06 July 2026."
 ] .


