:AgeGroup rdfs:comment """Age group ranges were selected based on established AF clinical risk scores, namely HARMS-AF (Segan et al. (2023)), which assigns 1 point for age between 60 and 64 and 2 points for age above 64, and CH2EST (Alonso et al. (2013)), which assigns 2 points for age above 74.  

- Below 60
- 60 - 64
- 65 - 74
- Above 74""" ;
          rdfs:label "Age group" .


:AlcoholMisuse <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> "Alcohol abuse" ,
                                                                                "Alcohol use disorder" ,
                                                                                "Alcoholism" ;
               rdfs:comment "Alcohol misuse is when you drink in a way that's harmful, or when you're dependent on alcohol."@en ;
               rdfs:label "Alcohol misuse" .

