<http://purl.org/phmo#AnthropometricFactor> rdfs:comment "A class to group risk factors for atrial fribrillation related to a person's body, e.g. height and BMI." ;
                                            rdfs:label "Anthropometric factor" .


<http://purl.org/phmo#BMICategory> rdfs:comment """For adults, BMI falls into the following categories:

- Underweight: below 18.5
- Normal: 18.5 - 24.9
- Overweight: 25.0 - 29.9
- Obese I: 30.0 - 34.9
- Obese II: 35.0 - 39.9
- Obese III: above 40.0""" ;
                                   rdfs:label "BMI category" .


<http://purl.org/phmo#DemographicFactor> rdfs:comment "A class to group risk factors for atrial fribrillation related to a person's demographics. Demographics: the qualities (such as age and sex) of a specific group of people."@en ;
                                         rdfs:label "Demographic factor" .


<http://purl.org/phmo#LifestyleFactor> rdfs:comment "A class to group risk factors for atrial fribrillation related to a person's lifestyle and choices."@en ;
                                       rdfs:label "Lifestyle factor" .


